[p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45617908/e06a273f3218cec6f41b5ef0080f7f8e1818757e.png"][/img][/p][p][b]Character Profile: Su Lianxiang[/b][/p][p][b]Faction:[/b] Cold Plum Pavilion[/p][p][b]Weapons:[/b] Twin Red-Thread Silver Needles[/p][p][b]Personality:[/b] Cold, efficient, unyielding, fiercely loyal[/p][p][b]Quirk:[/b] Sugar addict (obsessed with [i]tanghulu[/i] candy and dragon beard pastry)[/p][p][b]Motive:[/b] Execute her faction’s mission—assassinate the hidden mastermind behind the Martial Arts Tournament[/p][p][/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45617908/8246cd07bf6cb9dd39b1237b44d817aa86afea3a.png"][/img][b]Backstory[/b][/p][p][b]Orphaned in Snow[/b][/p][p][i]Poem: "Fate in the Snowflakes"[/i][/p][quote][p]Left amid swirling snow, eyes sharp as frost;
A fallen sparrow, hell’s crimson gate crossed.[/p][/quote][p]Abandoned as an infant, Su Lianxiang’s origins remain shrouded. At age five, her preternatural agility caught the eye of [b]Qin Miaohong[/b], mistress of the Vermilion Pavilion—a front for the assassin guild [i]Cold Plum Pavilion[/i]. When approached, the child bargained coolly: [i]"Take me if you have sweets."[/i][/p][p][b]Assassin’s Crucible[/b][/p][p][i]Poem: "Blood Plum Blossoms"[/i][/p][quote][p]Tempered in hellfire, grace meets the blade;
Death’s sweet game played, smiles hide the crusade.[/p][/quote][p]The Pavilion trained orphaned girls as killers through brutal trials. Where others broke or died, Su thrived:[/p][list][*][p]Mastered stealth, poisons, and close-quarters combat instinctively[/p][/*][*][p]Moved like a shadow, struck like a viper—outpacing veteran assassins[/p][/*][*][p][b]Chilling trait:[/b] Reveled in pain and death[/p][/*][/list][p][b]Earning Her Name[/b][/p][p][i]Poem: "Frostbloom Vengeance"[/i][/p][quote][p]Twelve winters honed, one strike ends life’s breath;
Corpses bloom plums—[i]"Su Lianxiang"[/i] in death.[/p][/quote][p]At age twelve, she assassinated the Haoran Sect’s leader. Posing as an innocent, she left the Cold Plum sigil on his corpse. Impressed, Qin Miaohong bestowed the name [b]"Su Lianxiang"[/b]—a mark of elite status reserved for master assassins.[/p][p][b]The Tournament Gambit[/b][/p][p]Sent to the Martial Arts Tournament to kill its shadow sponsor, Su believed herself unstoppable—until a [b]cold-eyed youth[/b] she’d crossed blades with before emerged from the crowd...[/p][p][/p][p]Uncover her full story in-game![/p][p][/p][p][b]Support Us:[/b][/p][p][b]Wishlist & Follow:[/b][/p][p][dynamiclink href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3378130/_Fighting_Rogue/"][/dynamiclink][/p]
